flowchart TD
    A[Start main()] --> B[Create ROS 2 node]
    B --> C[Load parameters and TensorRT engine]
    C --> D[Subscribe to synchronized RGB + depth images]

    D --> E[_sync_cb()]
    E --> F[Convert ROS images]
    F --> G{Valid depth image?}

    G -- No --> H[Skip frame]
    G -- Yes --> I{Engine loaded?}

    I -- No --> J[Empty detections]
    I -- Yes --> K[_infer()]

    K --> L[Prepare RGB image]
    L --> M[Letterbox to 640 x 640]
    M --> N[Run TensorRT]
    N --> O[Receive raw output]
    O --> P[_decode_yolov5_output()]

    P --> Q[Confidence threshold]
    Q --> R[Convert and correct boxes]
    R --> S[Apply NMS]
    S --> T[Candidate detections]

    J --> U[Geometry filtering]
    T --> U

    U --> V{Filter enabled?}
    V -- No --> W[Keep candidate]
    V -- Yes --> X[compute_geometry()]
    X --> Y[decide()]
    Y --> Z{KEEP or REJECT?}

    Z -- KEEP --> W
    Z -- REJECT --> AA[Record rejection]

    W --> AB[Publish detections and debug image]
    AA --> AB
    AB --> AC[Record timing]
    AC --> D
